# <type>(optional scope): <short summary>
#
# Types:
# feat     → new feature
# fix      → bug fix
# docs     → documentation only
# style    → formatting (no code change)
# refactor → code change without feature/bug
# test     → adding tests
# chore    → build/infra stuff
#
# Examples:
# feat(auth): add login with Google
# fix(api): handle 500 error
#
# Body (optional):
# Explain WHY this change was made, not WHAT.
#
# Footer (optional):
# BREAKING CHANGE: describe breaking change
# Closes #123
